WHAT IS NOT REDISTRIBUTED HERE
------------------------------

No proprietary Funcom code, container images, server binaries, stored
procedures, game assets, textures, meshes, icons, or other distributable
assets are included in this repository.

Where our tooling needs game-derived data (for example item icons or meshes
used by the player portal), this repository ships the script only. The
portal's icons, names and map glyphs are fetched by scripts/build-portal-assets.py
from the awakening.wiki community API, whose content licence (CC BY-NC-SA)
binds the files you download; everything else you run against your own
licensed installation of the game. In both cases the output stays on your own
machine. Nothing derived from Funcom's files is committed here or served from
this repository.

